Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 11 \N {\fs100}  Infidelity {浮気の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.73,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This, and that... \NAll in place.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.33,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, did I forget anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.82,0:00:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.53,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you forgot this!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.54,0:00:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, three days \Nis a long time, isn't it? {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.27,0:00:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Three days go by in a blink. {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.77,0:00:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my business is done, I'll be right back home.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.27,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Ah, no, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.27,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to see your dear mother, \Nso take your time with it. {???????}{what was so hard about those past 4 sentences?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about me. \NI won't feel lonely, no ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.61,0:01:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a caring husband I've got.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.47,0:01:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you'll find a change of clothes in the dresser. {clothing tansu}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.77,0:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.94,0:01:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat anything weird.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.12,0:01:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful with the water you drink. \NAnd give my best regards to your mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.15,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.54,0:01:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, finally, she's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.74,0:01:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days, huh? Three days...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.44,0:01:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, three days...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.51,0:01:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.01,0:01:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.80,0:01:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.47,0:01:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace! {or just delete this line, I believe he's not saying anything}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.50,0:01:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I wonder how many years it's been \Nsince it was last this quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.75,0:02:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my chance. \NYes, a chance like this is not to be missed! {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.62,0:02:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, though... \NNow's not the time to sit back and relax. {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.41,0:02:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days! \NI must make the most of those three days!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.85,0:02:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly the kind of time when you take the bull by the horns and overcome all obstacles! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.30,0:02:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so lively. \NYou can't tell what's on man's mind. {???????}{amazing how you couldn't even distinguish that "otoko tte nani kangaeteru no ka wakaranai wa" and put in the complete opposite}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.09,0:02:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In his current state, he's docile{for 'kawaii"}. {????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.85,0:02:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.77,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen his face? \NIt's as if he's bewitched. {?????????}{蕩けそう}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.86,0:02:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be like that until his wife returns. {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.35,0:03:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Long time no see.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.65,0:03:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come inside, dear.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.81,0:03:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have we met before, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.98,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.70,0:03:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels so nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, and what's that I've found?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.96,0:03:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.17,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it tickles!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.10,0:03:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.74,0:03:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.49,0:03:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like another bottle.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I'm tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.35,0:03:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Papa?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.95,0:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa! {holy shit I WISH that was ME!}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.64,0:04:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here early today, Papa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.89,0:04:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, she even calls him "Papa"? {not her real dad btw}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems, you can only be a popular guy \Nif you have endless money and power.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The night is still young!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My bachelor's life has just barely started.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have much nicer things yet to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.86,0:04:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He-he, I could actually go straight to {\i1}that{\i0}... {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.74,0:04:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, stop. No need to be hasty. \NBeing hasty only makes you look foolish.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! That's a bombshell if I ever seen one.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.22,0:04:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What a hearty person.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a wonderful, \Nreliable man.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.45,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one charming creature yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.78,0:05:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you come along with me tonight?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.10,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that tonight will be \Na night to remember for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.23,0:05:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, let’s ask for the check.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You want to ask for another round? {??????????? lit: if you came to a refill, it's no good}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.86,0:05:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so expensive!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Right then, thanks for waiting.\N I'm ready to go with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just recalled I need to be somewhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.04,0:05:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.55,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had such grand plans for tonight,\Nbut it all went up in smoke. {???????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.04,0:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so lonely...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, water! Give me some water!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.42,0:06:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me some water!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.82,0:06:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me water... \NPlease, some water...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, my wife is not here.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.79,0:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what remains won't take me far...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.37,0:06:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I could borrow some from that lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.03,0:06:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.23,0:06:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.\N I know that feeling so well!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.44,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.75,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.50,0:06:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to help...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.55,0:06:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me put on my makeup...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.42,0:06:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.74,0:07:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it does feel nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think my back is too plain? {???????????????}{飽き過ぎて}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.83,0:07:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! \NIt's looking just right to me. { (state of) health; physical condition​}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.54,0:07:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.84,0:07:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've saved me, really. \NI don't deserve such a kind man.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.87,0:07:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems properly flustered.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.64,0:07:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'd better not let her wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.13,0:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something. \NExcuse me for a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Turns out the Elder \Nloves some female company too. {????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.11,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Elder has matured past his desires{枯れたお方}. \NI should follow his example.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.29,0:08:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawing pictures is a pretty good distraction.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.35,0:08:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can devote myself to art \Nwhile my wife is away.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, what a great start.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.25,0:08:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Long way off, {???????}{hidoi}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.09,0:08:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,your carnal desires still show. {??????????}{未だ心眼が残ってる}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.84,0:08:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasted a lot of precious time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.84,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? This smell talks to me \Nin some strangely familiar language...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.43,0:08:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's the Nymph's house. {仙女}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.82,0:08:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good appetite and good looks \Nalways go hand in hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.82,0:08:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. If I may ask you something...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.88,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.46,0:09:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any food places around? {not strictly what he says, but what it's meant by the line; you can change it back if you think I'm overstepping}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I have a good feeling about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.90,0:09:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I was just thinking, \Neating alone would be awfully lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.39,0:09:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if you insist, I'll take you up on it. {?????????}{https://www.weblio.jp/content/お言葉に甘えて}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.00,0:09:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me tell you, when I'm traveling alone, I always end up missing
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,this kind of homey atmosphere.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.98,0:09:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It just happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.99,0:09:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a charming man.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.80,0:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, your sweet smell suddenly makes \Nmy gray life bloom with the colors of roses. {joke about this being a b&w show?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.06,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.65,0:09:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My! How indecent! Simply outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.72,0:09:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe even Big Sis \Nlet herself fall for it! {"senior Nymph" sounds too formal}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.42,0:09:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there? Don't bother us! {?????????}{what's to ??? here?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.75,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it can't be... {???????????}{そんなはずはない}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.50,0:10:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he tricked me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.26,0:10:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it! I hate him!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.59,0:10:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.76,0:10:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't let them fool you that easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.03,0:10:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My, so that's what it was?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.22,0:10:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Fool her?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.87,0:10:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It was going so well. {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.21,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no way my wife had returned already, \Nso I shouldn't have panicked so soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.99,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.29,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here again?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.16,0:10:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, stop fooling around now. \NYou shouldn't be teasing your elders, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.97,0:10:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my wife only returns tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.37,0:10:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, for such a kid, you sure like getting in the way of adults. {???????????? no idea who he's talking to}{are you retarded? He's talking to his wife as if she was that newer nymph who transformed to spook him out of having sex with the older Nymph}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I interrupt something \Nby coming a day early?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I need to be elsewhere! {lit: remembered a business}
Comment: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
